            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The device “%1$(deviceName)@” wouldn't take a %2$(requestedBuffer)lld sample buffer size and used %3$(actualBuffer)lld instead. Both devices have to run the same buffer size — pick another value."
          }
        }
      }
    },
